  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "かっこよさを　追求した　ピック。食べたあとに　伝説の勇者ごっこが　できる。観光地の　お土産屋に　何故か　売っている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "멋을 추구하는 픽. 다 먹고 나면 전설의 용사 놀이를 할 수 있다. 어째선지 관광지의 기념품 매장에서 팔고 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "展現對帥氣之追求的小籤。吃完後能用它充當起傳說中的勇者。觀光地的特產店很神奇地會販售這種產品。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique pour les gens qui savent ce qui est cool. Permet de se prendre pour un héros de légende après avoir mangé. Fréquente dans les magasins de souvenirs.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Pikser, um Eindruck zu schinden. Nach dem Essen kann man damit in die Rolle eines Helden schlüpfen. Souvenirläden führen ihn seltsamerweise im Angebot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diseñado para impresionar, suele encontrarse en las tiendas de recuerdos para turistas. Tras comer, se puede usar para jugar a ser un héroe de leyenda.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino per veri duri. Dopo mangiato si può giocare all’eroe leggendario. Sorprende un po’ vederlo nei negozi di souvenir di luoghi turistici.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A pick made to be the coolest. Once you’ve eaten, you can pretend you’re a hero of legend. Souvenir shops at tourist spots sell these for some reason.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かっこよさを　追求した　ピック。食べたあとに　伝説の勇者ごっこが　できる。観光地の　お土産屋に　何故か　売っている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "追求帅气的签子。餐后能用来装传说中的勇者来玩游戏。不知为何会在观光胜地的特产店中贩卖。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
